    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="50c66625-c53e-52af-a511-099a273d1402" activityNameId="1c8c4f93-518d-5d74-9347-fd25e75ae198" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">LCD flat screen, 17 inches, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: LCD flat screen, 17 inches, at plant
Data are based on information from a recent European Research project dealing with the recycling / reuse of LCD screens. The total weight is based on an internet survey of 90 different 17-inch LCD screens on the market. In 2023, the inventory is updated using the bill of materials data from Babbiet et al 2020; UUID: a8a1011a-a710-327b-ac1f-27af1d16b5fb
This module includes the various parts of a complete 17-inch computer LCD screen. All further efforts (auxiliaries, energy, emissions, waste, ?) are included in a separate module ? that is linked to this module here.
Location: Data from research project &amp; internet survey information
Technology: 17 inch, a-Si, TFT LCD color screen
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: n.a.
Sampling: EU research &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: see generalComment
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a8a1011a-a710-327b-ac1f-27af1d16b5fb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
